flowchart TD
    G[Bank vendor-onboarding goal] --> S[Strands Agent]
    S --> T1[execute_safe_vendor_work]
    S --> T2[get_authority_cut]
    S --> T3[execute_authorized_vendor_work]
    T1 --> C[Shared ControlPlane]
    T2 --> C
    T3 --> C

    E[Authoritative regulatory evidence] --> B[BANK-ECP public evidence gate]
    B -->|PASS / HOLD / ABSTAIN| C

    H[External Human Principal] --> API[Human Authority API: approve / deny / revoke]
    API --> C

    C --> P[Policy + current authority]
    P --> X[Safe or authorized tool effects]
    X --> R[Receipts / execution state]

    B -->|later PASS to HOLD| INV[Invalidate stale vendor-risk authority]
    INV --> COMP[Compensate affected reversible descendants]
    COMP --> KEEP[Preserve unrelated safe work]
    KEEP --> IRR[First payment cannot execute under stale authority]

    API -->|human correction| INV
